<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Poem Grid Collection</title>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #d1d1d1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Songti SC", STSong, "SimSun", serif;
  }

  .grid-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    background-color: #d1d1d1;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
  }

  .cell {
    background-color: #f7f6f2; /* Off-white paper tone */
    padding: 10% 12%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 450px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
  }

  .poem-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .title {
    width: 1.2em;
    word-wrap: break-word;
    word-break: break-all;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #222;
    border-right: 1px solid #444;
    padding-right: 15px;
    margin-right: 20px;
  }

  .content {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 2.2;
    color: #333;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .durex-logo {
    margin-top: auto;
    align-self: center;
    border: 1px solid #b5b5b5;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2px 15px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #b5b5b5;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: -10px;
  }

  .placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    white-space: normal;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="grid-container">

  <!-- Row 1, Col 1 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">口红游戏</div>
      <div class="content">
        用吻，<br>
        在你苦苦练就的腹肌上，<br>
        下一盘棋。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 1, Col 2 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">讲解词</div>
      <div class="content">
        三千年后，<br>
        他们的屋子，<br>
        成为人类最后一个遗迹。<br>
        <br>
        讲解员说：<br>
        这里的每把椅子，<br>
        都擦过他们两个人。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 1, Col 3 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">人类研习课</div>
      <div class="content" style="position: relative;">
        夜晚来临，<br>
        一群麻雀，<br>
        站在窗前，<br>
        认真记笔记：<br>
        人类情侣的显性特征是——<br>
        屋子很大，<br>
        但他们要贴在一起。<br>
        啾～
        <div class="placeholder" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; position: absolute; right: -20px; bottom: 0px;">[Sketch: Faint pencil marks and bird doodle]</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 2, Col 1 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">站稳扶好</div>
      <div class="content">
        地铁指示标写：<br>
        站稳扶好。<br>
        今晚，<br>
        我也打算这样提醒你。
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="durex-logo">durex</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 2, Col 2 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">镜子</div>
      <div class="content">
        17<br>
        21<br>
        57<br>
        69<br>
        早上我照镜子时突然有点害羞，<br>
        觉得它什么都看见了。
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="durex-logo">durex</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 2, Col 3 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">独一份的时尚</div>
      <div class="content">
        我这么一个人，<br>
        哪懂什么时尚，<br>
        留过时的发型，<br>
        唱过时的歌，<br>
        跳过时的舞，<br>
        穿过时的衣服。<br>
        <br>
        我这么一个人，<br>
        为了时尚的你，<br>
        通红着脸，<br>
        学了几个时兴的姿势。
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="durex-logo">durex</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 3, Col 1 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">我们身体的实时天气</div>
      <div class="content">
        雨，<br>
        一会儿落，<br>
        一会儿停。<br>
        <br>
        伞，<br>
        一会儿撑，<br>
        一会儿合。<br>
        <br>
        我，<br>
        一会儿想你，<br>
        一会儿又想你。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 3, Col 2 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">毕生宏愿</div>
      <div class="content">
        代替那名医生，<br>
        为你做一场全面体检。<br>
        还要在你的基因里，<br>
        植入一场爱我的突变。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Row 3, Col 3 -->
  <div class="cell">
    <div class="poem-container">
      <div class="title">象限游戏</div>
      <div class="content">
        我180°地躺，<br>
        你90°地坐，<br>
        搭一架，<br>
        只有一二象限的坐标系。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
```
